WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:04.648
Water...

00:04.857 --> 00:06.358
Earth...

00:06.567 --> 00:08.694
Fire...

00:08.903 --> 00:10.487
Air.

00:11.322 --> 00:15.367
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.451 --> 00:18.745
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.789 --> 00:22.499
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.583 --> 00:23.709
could stop them.

00:23.793 --> 00:25.627
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.712 --> 00:27.004
he vanished.

00:27.422 --> 00:31.216
100 years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.301 --> 00:32.884
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.262
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.346 --> 00:37.848
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.932 --> 00:38.932
Oof.

00:39.017 --> 00:42.269
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:04.208 --> 01:06.877
This should give us a good idea
of what's around here.

01:07.003 --> 01:08.045
See if you can find a menu.

01:08.129 --> 01:09.379
I'm starving.

01:09.464 --> 01:11.298
I bet we'll find something
to eat here...

01:11.382 --> 01:13.342
The Fire Days Festival.

01:13.676 --> 01:15.594
Fire Nation cultural exhibits,

01:15.803 --> 01:17.596
jugglers, benders, magicians...

01:18.264 --> 01:21.558
This would be a great place for me
to study some real firebenders.

01:21.642 --> 01:22.976
You might want to rethink that.

01:23.061 --> 01:24.061
Look at this.

01:24.854 --> 01:26.438
Hey, a poster of me!

01:26.522 --> 01:28.023
A wanted poster.

01:28.358 --> 01:29.733
This is bad.

01:30.693 --> 01:31.985
I think we better keep moving.

01:32.403 --> 01:34.112
I have to learn firebending
at some point,

01:34.322 --> 01:37.824
and this could be my only chance
to watch some masters up close.

01:38.034 --> 01:39.618
I guess we could go check it out.

01:39.952 --> 01:41.078
What?

01:41.162 --> 01:42.746
You want to walk into
a Fire Nation town

01:42.830 --> 01:45.749
when they're all fired up
with all their, you know, fire?

01:45.958 --> 01:47.209
We'll wear disguises.

01:47.293 --> 01:48.794
And if it looks like trouble,
we'll leave.

01:48.878 --> 01:50.045
Yeah.

01:50.129 --> 01:52.756
Because we always leave
before we get into trouble.

02:03.434 --> 02:05.936
You guys stay out of sight here
while we go to the festival.

02:13.694 --> 02:15.320
Ready disguises.

02:23.079 --> 02:25.330
It's like you're a whole
different person.

02:25.415 --> 02:26.790
Let's go!

02:34.715 --> 02:36.091
Ha ha ha ha!

02:42.682 --> 02:45.267
I think we need
some new disguises.

02:45.476 --> 02:47.686
Where are we gonna get
masks like that?

02:47.895 --> 02:51.606
Get your genuine
Fire-Festival masks here!

02:51.691 --> 02:53.817
That was surprisingly easy.

03:03.911 --> 03:05.245
Hey, there's some food.

03:05.329 --> 03:06.329
Finally!

03:06.831 --> 03:08.039
What do you have?

03:08.124 --> 03:09.249
Flaming fire flakes.

03:09.333 --> 03:10.375
Best in town.

03:10.460 --> 03:11.460
I'll take 'em.

03:13.921 --> 03:15.297
Hot, hot!

03:15.381 --> 03:18.049
Flaming fire flakes, hot.

03:18.134 --> 03:19.134
What do you know?

03:19.218 --> 03:20.218
Hey, look at this!

03:22.805 --> 03:24.723
Don't worry, loyal citizens,

03:24.932 --> 03:27.976
no one can surprise the Fire Lord!

03:28.186 --> 03:29.811
- No!
- Look out!

03:36.194 --> 03:37.360
Aang, hold on.

03:37.445 --> 03:38.570
Where are we going?

03:38.654 --> 03:39.654
I don't know...

03:39.739 --> 03:41.907
But there's a big crowd,
so it must be good.

03:41.991 --> 03:43.116
Knowing the Fire Nation,

03:43.201 --> 03:44.618
it's probably an execution.

03:52.710 --> 03:54.336
I gotta learn that trick.

03:54.420 --> 03:55.545
Thank you!

03:55.630 --> 03:56.671
For my next trick,

03:56.756 --> 03:58.715
I need a volunteer from the audience.

03:58.799 --> 04:00.217
Ooh, ooh! Me! me!

04:00.301 --> 04:01.801
What do you think you're doing?

04:01.886 --> 04:03.553
I want to get a closer look.

04:03.638 --> 04:06.765
It's better that we don't attract
any attention to ourselves.

04:06.891 --> 04:08.642
How about you, little lady?

04:09.852 --> 04:11.811
Aw, she's shy.

04:11.896 --> 04:14.606
Let's give her some
encouragement, folks.

04:17.652 --> 04:19.569
Aw, that could have been me.

04:22.448 --> 04:26.868
This next trick is called
Taming the Dragon!

04:26.953 --> 04:28.787
You will be my captured princess.

04:39.715 --> 04:41.216
Don't worry, young maiden!

04:41.551 --> 04:44.427
I will tame this fiery beast!

04:49.725 --> 04:51.059
It's too strong!

04:51.143 --> 04:52.143
I can't hold it!

04:52.603 --> 04:53.895
We gotta help her!

04:53.980 --> 04:55.605
No, we don't want to make a scene.

04:55.690 --> 04:58.024
The rope... It's breaking!

05:08.578 --> 05:10.745
Hey, you trying to upstage me, kid?

05:17.837 --> 05:20.130
Hey! That kid's the Avatar!

05:25.136 --> 05:26.678
I think it's time to go.

05:26.762 --> 05:27.804
Follow me!

05:27.888 --> 05:29.014
I can get you out of here!

05:29.098 --> 05:30.098
There they are!

05:39.609 --> 05:40.609
Over there!

05:43.487 --> 05:44.779
I'm calling Appa.

05:47.783 --> 05:49.826
I hope he can really hear
that bison whistle!

05:49.910 --> 05:51.077
This way!

05:53.080 --> 05:54.873
Ok, not this way.

06:09.847 --> 06:11.681
Appa, down here!

06:32.286 --> 06:33.662
Beautiful!

06:37.625 --> 06:39.668
Nice touch setting off the fireworks.

06:39.752 --> 06:41.795
You seem to really know
your explosives.

06:41.879 --> 06:42.879
I'm familiar.

06:43.297 --> 06:44.714
You're a Fire Nation soldier.

06:44.799 --> 06:45.882
Was.

06:45.966 --> 06:47.425
My name's Chey.

06:50.096 --> 06:51.596
I serve a man...

06:51.681 --> 06:52.847
More than a man, really,

06:52.932 --> 06:54.015
he's a myth...

06:54.100 --> 06:56.059
But he's real, a living legend...

06:56.143 --> 06:57.977
Jeong Jeong the Deserter.

06:58.062 --> 07:00.146
He was a Fire Nation general.

07:00.356 --> 07:02.273
Or wait... Was he an admiral?

07:02.483 --> 07:04.401
He was very highly ranked. We get it.

07:04.568 --> 07:06.236
Yeah! Way up there!

07:06.320 --> 07:08.196
But he couldn't take
the madness anymore.

07:08.280 --> 07:11.199
He's the first person ever
to leave the army and live.

07:11.283 --> 07:13.660
I'm the second, but you don't
get to be a legend for that.

07:13.744 --> 07:14.744
It's ok, though.

07:15.204 --> 07:17.288
Jeong Jeong's a firebending genius.

07:17.498 --> 07:18.790
Some say he's mad,

07:18.874 --> 07:20.291
but he's not.

07:20.376 --> 07:21.751
He's enlightened.

07:21.877 --> 07:23.420
You mean there's a firebender out here

07:23.504 --> 07:24.921
who's not with the Fire Lord?

07:25.005 --> 07:26.172
We've gotta go see him!

07:26.257 --> 07:27.257
He can train me!

07:27.591 --> 07:30.009
We're not gonna go find
some crazy firebender.

07:30.219 --> 07:31.803
He's not crazy!

07:31.887 --> 07:33.596
He's a genius!

07:33.681 --> 07:36.182
And he's the perfect person
to train the Avatar.

07:36.267 --> 07:38.518
That's why I followed you
into the festival.

07:38.602 --> 07:39.978
Look, thanks for the help,

07:40.062 --> 07:42.230
but we're leaving for the North Pole
in the morning.

07:42.314 --> 07:46.526
Sokka, this could be my only chance
to meet a firebending master

07:46.610 --> 07:48.945
who would actually be willing
to teach me.

07:49.029 --> 07:50.739
It can't hurt just to talk to him.

07:50.823 --> 07:53.283
That's what you said about
going to the festival!

07:53.367 --> 07:55.368
Why doesn't anyone ever listen to me?

07:57.371 --> 07:58.371
Aagh!

08:01.459 --> 08:03.209
Don't move.

08:11.427 --> 08:13.636
Jeong Jeong told you
not to look for Avatar.

08:13.721 --> 08:15.388
Hold on. You know these guys?

08:15.556 --> 08:16.598
Yeah.

08:16.682 --> 08:17.891
Lin Ye's an old buddy.

08:18.017 --> 08:19.100
Right, Lin Ye?

08:19.185 --> 08:20.602
Shut up. Keep moving.

08:30.404 --> 08:32.781
Go on. He sees you only.

08:32.948 --> 08:34.073
That's ok.

08:34.158 --> 08:35.450
We can chat later.

08:35.534 --> 08:36.910
Is that where Jeong Jeong is?

08:36.994 --> 08:38.578
I need to talk to him right away.

08:38.662 --> 08:40.288
No. You wait there.

08:40.372 --> 08:41.956
Go, now!

08:42.041 --> 08:44.209
Don't worry. Everything will be fine.

08:44.710 --> 08:45.919
He's a great man.

08:46.003 --> 08:47.253
A great man!

08:52.009 --> 08:53.968
So, the Avatar was here

08:54.053 --> 08:55.512
and you let him slip away?

08:55.763 --> 08:56.846
Yes, sir.

08:56.931 --> 08:59.390
But other than that,
the festival went off without a hitch.

09:00.893 --> 09:02.811
No fights. Theft was way down.

09:03.187 --> 09:05.647
I don't care
about your local crime rates!

09:05.731 --> 09:07.398
Which way did they go?

09:07.733 --> 09:09.067
They headed into the forest.

09:09.276 --> 09:10.568
Up the river, I suspect.

09:10.736 --> 09:12.654
Ready the riverboats.

09:12.738 --> 09:14.823
We're going after the Avatar.

09:23.541 --> 09:26.125
What happened?
Can I see Jeong Jeong now?

09:26.210 --> 09:27.544
He won't see you.

09:27.628 --> 09:29.754
He's very angry
that I brought you here.

09:29.839 --> 09:31.339
He wants you to leave immediately.

09:31.423 --> 09:33.258
Finally! Let's hit the road.

09:33.342 --> 09:34.801
Why won't he see me?

09:35.386 --> 09:36.761
He says you're not ready.

09:36.846 --> 09:39.597
Says you haven't mastered
waterbending and earthbending yet.

09:39.682 --> 09:41.349
Wait, how does he know that?

09:41.642 --> 09:43.685
He saw the way you walked into camp.

09:43.769 --> 09:45.019
He can tell.

09:45.104 --> 09:46.312
I'm going in anyway.

09:56.282 --> 09:57.782
Get out!

10:00.744 --> 10:03.496
Master, I need to learn firebending.

10:03.581 --> 10:07.500
Only a fool seeks his own destruction.

10:07.835 --> 10:09.294
I am the Avatar.

10:09.378 --> 10:11.045
-It's my destiny to...
-Destiny?

10:11.130 --> 10:13.381
What would a boy know of destiny?

10:13.465 --> 10:16.134
If a fish lives its whole life
in this river,

10:16.218 --> 10:17.969
does he know the river's destiny?

10:18.053 --> 10:19.220
No!

10:19.305 --> 10:22.307
Only that it runs on and on
out of his control.

10:22.391 --> 10:24.017
He may follow where it flows,

10:24.101 --> 10:26.394
but he cannot see the end.

10:26.478 --> 10:28.771
He cannot imagine the ocean.

10:29.440 --> 10:31.107
Ok...

10:31.191 --> 10:32.567
But it's the Avatar's duty

10:32.651 --> 10:34.903
to master all of
the bending disciplines.

10:34.987 --> 10:37.155
To master the bending disciplines,

10:37.239 --> 10:40.074
you must first master
discipline itself.

10:40.326 --> 10:41.910
But you have no interest in this,

10:41.994 --> 10:43.536
so I have no interest in you.

10:43.621 --> 10:45.663
Now, get out.

10:45.748 --> 10:48.291
Please, I have to learn.

10:48.375 --> 10:49.959
This could be my only chance.

10:50.377 --> 10:51.586
Are you deaf?

10:51.670 --> 10:55.048
How can I teach you
if you refuse to listen?

10:55.132 --> 10:56.883
Before learning firebending,

10:56.967 --> 10:59.052
you must learn water and earth.

10:59.136 --> 11:01.179
Water is cool and soothing.

11:01.263 --> 11:03.181
Earth is steady and stable.

11:03.390 --> 11:04.599
But fire...

11:04.683 --> 11:06.392
Fire is alive.

11:06.477 --> 11:08.686
It breathes, it grows.

11:08.771 --> 11:11.356
Without the bender,
a rock will not throw itself.

11:11.565 --> 11:12.857
But fire will spread

11:12.942 --> 11:15.068
and destroy everything in its path

11:15.152 --> 11:17.820
if one does not have
the will to control it!

11:18.322 --> 11:19.697
That is its destiny.

11:19.865 --> 11:21.199
You are not ready!

11:21.283 --> 11:23.284
You are too weak!

11:28.082 --> 11:29.540
You think I am weak?

11:29.625 --> 11:31.292
Avatar Roku!

11:31.377 --> 11:32.502
No, no!

11:32.586 --> 11:33.711
I did not mean that.

11:33.796 --> 11:35.338
I have mastered the elements

11:35.422 --> 11:38.633
a thousand times
in a thousand lifetimes.

11:38.717 --> 11:41.427
Now, I must do it once again.

11:41.637 --> 11:46.015
You will teach the Avatar firebending.

11:46.100 --> 11:47.433
Yes, yes.

11:47.893 --> 11:49.727
I will teach you.

11:49.812 --> 11:50.812
Really?

11:51.063 --> 11:52.271
That's great!

11:59.238 --> 12:00.697
Widen your stance.

12:02.199 --> 12:04.033
Wider!

12:04.118 --> 12:05.326
Bend your knees.

12:05.411 --> 12:06.869
Now, concentrate.

12:07.579 --> 12:09.205
Good. Good!

12:09.289 --> 12:10.581
Wait. What do I do now?

12:11.000 --> 12:13.793
Silence! Talking is not concentrating.

12:13.877 --> 12:15.920
Look at your friend. Is she talking?

12:16.005 --> 12:18.339
Even that oaf knows to concentrate
on what he's doing.

12:18.424 --> 12:19.424
Hey!

12:19.758 --> 12:21.718
But what am I concentrating on?

12:21.802 --> 12:24.303
Feel the heat of the sun.

12:24.388 --> 12:26.597
It is the greatest source of fire,

12:26.682 --> 12:29.308
yet it is in complete balance
with nature.

12:29.518 --> 12:31.019
So, when do I get to make some fire?

12:31.103 --> 12:32.937
Concentrate!

12:44.074 --> 12:45.616
Are we coming up here
so I don't burn anything

12:45.701 --> 12:46.701
with my fire blasts?

12:46.952 --> 12:48.369
No fire yet.

12:48.454 --> 12:49.537
What?

12:50.539 --> 12:53.291
Power in firebending
comes from the breath.

12:53.375 --> 12:56.044
That is why you must master
proper breath control.

12:56.879 --> 12:58.713
You brought me up here to breathe?

12:58.797 --> 13:00.298
Assume your stance.

13:00.382 --> 13:01.424
Wider.

13:01.508 --> 13:02.717
-You're not even look...
-Wider!

13:02.801 --> 13:06.054
Now, inhale through the nose
and exhale through the mouth...

13:06.138 --> 13:07.138
Without talking.

13:11.643 --> 13:13.478
Good. Keep going.

13:23.989 --> 13:25.281
What are you doing here?

13:25.365 --> 13:26.908
I did not tell you to stop!

13:26.992 --> 13:28.576
I've been breathing for hours.

13:28.911 --> 13:30.703
You want to stop breathing?

13:30.913 --> 13:33.206
I want you to stop wasting my time.

13:33.290 --> 13:35.124
I already know
how to squat and breathe

13:35.209 --> 13:36.292
and feel the sun.

13:36.376 --> 13:39.253
I want to know how to shoot fire
out of my fingertips.

13:41.215 --> 13:43.049
I had a pupil once

13:43.133 --> 13:46.302
who had no interest
in learning discipline.

13:46.386 --> 13:49.263
He was only concerned
with the power of fire...

13:49.348 --> 13:51.557
How he could use it
to destroy his opponents

13:51.642 --> 13:54.894
and wipe out the obstacles
in his path,

13:54.978 --> 13:57.897
but fire is a horrible burden to bear.

13:58.232 --> 13:59.941
Its nature is to consume,

14:00.025 --> 14:03.945
and without control,
it destroys everything around it.

14:16.375 --> 14:17.792
Learn restraint,

14:17.876 --> 14:21.420
or risk destroying yourself
and everything you love.

14:31.181 --> 14:32.849
I thought about what you said.

14:32.933 --> 14:34.600
I promise I'll be more patient.

14:35.102 --> 14:37.979
We're going to work with fire now.

14:38.063 --> 14:39.188
Yeah!

14:41.441 --> 14:42.483
I mean...

14:42.568 --> 14:43.568
Let us begin.

14:46.697 --> 14:48.906
Concentrate on the fire.

14:49.283 --> 14:51.951
I want you to keep this flame
from reaching the edges of the leaf

14:52.035 --> 14:54.078
for as long as you can.

14:55.497 --> 14:57.373
Master, there is trouble!

14:57.457 --> 14:58.833
What's going on?!

14:58.917 --> 15:00.376
Concentrate on your leaf.

15:00.460 --> 15:02.879
This is the worst
firebending instruction ever.

15:02.963 --> 15:05.006
All he does
is leave me alone for hours

15:05.090 --> 15:06.757
to concentrate or breathe.

15:06.842 --> 15:08.634
I'm sure there's a good reason.

15:08.844 --> 15:11.012
But I'm ready to do so much more.

15:24.735 --> 15:26.736
I did it. I made fire!

15:27.946 --> 15:29.071
Aang, that's great.

15:29.156 --> 15:30.698
But you should take it slow.

15:30.782 --> 15:32.158
-Whoa!
-Careful!

15:32.326 --> 15:33.743
Aagh!

15:33.827 --> 15:35.536
Now, that's firebending.

15:37.789 --> 15:39.373
Aang, you'll hurt yourself.

15:44.796 --> 15:46.297
I wonder how that juggler did it.

15:52.679 --> 15:53.971
Katara!

15:54.056 --> 15:55.473
I'm so sorry!

15:56.892 --> 15:58.476
Katara, what's wrong?

15:58.685 --> 15:59.977
What did you do?

16:00.145 --> 16:01.562
It was an accident!

16:01.647 --> 16:03.314
I was... Katara, I'm so...

16:04.483 --> 16:06.150
I told you we shouldn't
mess around with this!

16:06.235 --> 16:07.318
Look what you did!

16:07.444 --> 16:09.320
You burned my sister!

16:23.961 --> 16:26.087
You burned my sister!

16:26.296 --> 16:28.005
This is all your fault!

16:28.215 --> 16:29.840
I know! Now, pack your things.

16:29.925 --> 16:31.592
You must leave immediately.

16:32.344 --> 16:33.761
I'm sorry.

16:33.845 --> 16:35.137
I didn't...

16:35.222 --> 16:36.555
I'm sorry!

17:06.211 --> 17:08.212
You have healing abilities.

17:09.047 --> 17:12.967
The great benders of the Water Tribes
sometimes have this ability.

17:13.051 --> 17:16.012
I've always wished
I were blessed like you...

17:16.096 --> 17:18.681
Free from this burning curse.

17:18.765 --> 17:20.641
But you're a great master.

17:20.726 --> 17:22.476
You have powers I'll never know.

17:22.561 --> 17:25.688
Water brings healing and life.

17:25.772 --> 17:29.025
But fire brings only destruction
and pain.

17:29.109 --> 17:31.569
It forces those of us
burdened with its care

17:31.653 --> 17:36.032
to walk a razor's edge
between humanity and savagery.

17:36.199 --> 17:39.327
Eventually we're torn apart.

17:46.168 --> 17:48.461
Go get your friends and flee!

17:48.754 --> 17:51.422
Do not come back here
or you will all be destroyed!

17:51.506 --> 17:52.757
Hurry!

18:11.109 --> 18:12.610
Don't worry, men.

18:12.694 --> 18:15.780
My old teacher gave up fighting
a long time ago...

18:17.366 --> 18:19.367
Haven't you, Master Jeong Jeong?

18:26.375 --> 18:28.084
Katara, are you all right?

18:28.168 --> 18:29.377
I'm fine.

18:29.461 --> 18:30.669
We've gotta get out of here.

18:30.754 --> 18:31.921
Where's Aang?

18:39.554 --> 18:42.181
Jeong Jeong tried to tell me
that I wasn't ready.

18:42.265 --> 18:43.808
I wouldn't listen.

18:43.892 --> 18:45.768
I'm never gonna firebend again.

18:45.852 --> 18:47.436
You'll have to eventually.

18:47.687 --> 18:49.688
No, never again.

18:49.773 --> 18:51.941
It's ok, Aang. I'm healed.

18:52.025 --> 18:53.651
What? How?

18:53.735 --> 18:55.194
I'll explain later.

18:55.278 --> 18:56.987
But, right now,
we have to get out of here.

18:57.155 --> 18:59.240
Zhao and his soldiers are attacking.

18:59.324 --> 19:00.366
Where?

19:00.575 --> 19:01.700
By the river.

19:01.785 --> 19:03.285
They captured Jeong Jeong.

19:03.370 --> 19:04.995
I have to help him!

19:05.831 --> 19:06.914
Look at you.

19:06.998 --> 19:10.167
You were once so great.

19:10.252 --> 19:12.294
I can't believe my former master

19:12.379 --> 19:15.089
has become nothing more
than a simple savage.

19:15.173 --> 19:17.883
It is you who have embraced
savagery, Zhao.

19:17.968 --> 19:20.511
It's Admiral Zhao now.

19:20.595 --> 19:23.556
That title will not help you
against the Avatar.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.015
Do not try to fight him.

19:25.100 --> 19:26.767
You are no match.

19:26.852 --> 19:29.061
I think I can handle a child.

19:29.146 --> 19:33.023
I have never seen such raw power.

19:34.276 --> 19:35.359
Jeong Jeong!

19:35.444 --> 19:36.527
We'll see.

19:36.611 --> 19:38.279
Men, take The Deserter.

19:46.538 --> 19:47.746
It's a trick!

19:47.831 --> 19:49.081
He's run off into the woods.

19:49.166 --> 19:50.666
Find him!

19:51.877 --> 19:55.212
Let's find out what my old master
has taught you.

19:55.297 --> 19:57.047
You were Jeong Jeong's student?

19:57.132 --> 19:59.008
Until I got bored.

20:03.847 --> 20:06.682
I see he taught you
how to duck and run like a coward,

20:06.766 --> 20:10.686
but I doubt he showed you
what a firebender is truly capable of!

20:14.357 --> 20:15.774
Whoa! Wild shot!

20:15.859 --> 20:17.735
I'll show you wild!

20:24.993 --> 20:26.494
No self-control.

20:28.914 --> 20:30.706
Stand and fight, Avatar!

20:30.790 --> 20:32.249
Were we fighting?

20:32.334 --> 20:34.126
I thought you were
just getting warmed up.

20:34.211 --> 20:35.336
I was.

20:37.881 --> 20:39.215
Is that all you got?

20:39.299 --> 20:41.800
Man, they'll make anyone
an admiral these days.

20:47.891 --> 20:49.099
Ahoy!

20:49.184 --> 20:50.809
I'm Admiral Zhao.

20:58.985 --> 21:02.446
I don't know why, but I thought
you'd be better than Zuko.

21:02.614 --> 21:03.697
Aagh!

21:05.992 --> 21:07.201
Sloppy.

21:07.285 --> 21:09.119
Very sloppy.

21:21.383 --> 21:22.424
Nowhere to run now,

21:22.509 --> 21:24.301
you little smart mouth.

21:27.764 --> 21:29.348
You've lost this battle.

21:31.518 --> 21:32.518
Are you crazy?

21:32.852 --> 21:34.353
You haven't thrown a single blow.

21:34.521 --> 21:36.480
No, but you have.

21:42.696 --> 21:44.655
Jeong Jeong said you had no restraint.

21:53.999 --> 21:56.041
Have a nice walk home!

21:56.126 --> 21:57.418
Aang, come on!

21:57.502 --> 21:58.711
Let's go!

22:01.756 --> 22:03.215
Wait! Where's Jeong Jeong?

22:03.300 --> 22:04.883
He disappeared.

22:04.968 --> 22:06.176
They all did.

22:14.019 --> 22:15.728
Hey, where'd everybody go?

22:16.855 --> 22:18.230
Very funny, guys!

22:27.574 --> 22:29.241
Aang, you're burned.

22:31.745 --> 22:32.745
Let me help you.

22:45.508 --> 22:47.051
Wow! That's good water.

22:47.260 --> 22:49.261
When did you learn how to do that?

22:49.346 --> 22:50.554
I guess I always knew.

22:51.222 --> 22:52.389
Well, then,

22:52.474 --> 22:54.183
thanks for all the first aid
over the years...

22:54.267 --> 22:56.226
Like, when I fell into
the greaseberry bramble,

22:56.311 --> 22:59.188
and that time I had two fishhooks
in my thumb!

22:59.272 --> 23:00.481
Two?

23:00.565 --> 23:03.442
He tried to get the first fishhook out
with another fishhook.

23:03.526 --> 23:06.153
And the time
that mink snake bit me.

23:06.237 --> 23:07.780
Thanks for healing that up.

23:07.864 --> 23:09.823
That's great. Really helpful.
